recommend keep-going the ales choir is the next crux and the tier is now the seat that can hold it -- 239 unheard witnesses in one family, a fifth of the whole 1,176, and the cadence tier means seating it costs the every-lap roster nothing; beside it a staleness gate on the cadence tier, which wants a lap count to measure against and an honest answer for the untracked run card
